@commands Owner rule 2026-11-03 (plan_scratch_bugfix_1103 4.3): grass spreads normally in spring, autumn and winter and at half speed (`[crop_seasons] grassOffPenalty` 0.5) in summer and in tropical (wet/dry) biomes. As SQ-PST-03 with a 32x32 pad of `vinery:dirt_slab` (bottom) ringed with `vinery:grass_slab`; count with `/fill <pad> vinery:dirt_slab replace vinery:grass_slab`; then put stone on one grass slab in summer and wait 30 s (it still turns to a dirt slab); 3 runs each in `mid_spring`, `mid_summer`, `mid_winter` at randomTickSpeed 100, rebuilding the pad before each run; reset to 3. Boot log: `[creativecalendar] grass season hook live: <target>` once for this block
@pass summer mean about 50 % of spring (35 to 65 %); winter about equal to spring (85 to 115 %); the hook-live line present
@fails `VineryGrassSlabSeasonMixin` missing, or placed before the survive check
@jars creativecommon
@from batches/r1102b/s5_R_A.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@superseded VineryGrassSlabSeasonMixin deleted 2026-11-17; same steps on the direct hook are SQ-PST-09c (owner request, 2026-11-20)
