## SQ-PSM-03 | lone birch pillager tower: box probe and illager spawns inside
@phase worldgen
@group B
@commands `/locate structure mysticrift_pillagers_towers_aris:birch_pillager_tower` (a lone one, not in a meta) -> {BT1} {BT3}; tower base y {BY} from `zq` at the locate column; tp into the tower's ground floor, `/cwgspawnbox`; then `gamerule doPatrolSpawning false`, `difficulty peaceful`, `difficulty normal`, `time set 18000`; qa at {BT1} {BY+50} {BT3} (29+ blocks from every floor, so the 24-block rule never blocks the tower), `kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]`; every 30 s for 300 s: `execute if entity @e[type=X,x={BT1-15},y={BY},z={BT3-15},dx=30,dy=22,dz=30]` for X = pillager, vindicator, evoker, illusioner, witch; at the end `data get entity` Pos of any zombie/skeleton/creeper in that volume; `/cdevperf mobcap`; grep `latest.log` for `NaturalSpawnerBoxHeightMixin`
@pass probe: `box large_towers of mysticrift_pillagers_towers_aris:birch_pillager_tower -> [minecraft:pillager 7 (1-1), minecraft:vindicator 3 (1-1), minecraft:evoker 3 (1-1), minecraft:illusioner 3 (1-1), minecraft:witch 3 (1-1)]`; an illager (pillager at least) in at least 3 of the 10 counts; biome monsters only outside the tower walls; mobcap shows the unchanged monster cap (70 at level 0); no mixin apply error
@fails mixin error: SRG m_47045_ / m_47062_; probe right, cap not full, no illager: attempts not reaching the box (`boxHeight` span, `getAllReferences` empty in the tower chunks) or light; probe `no box`: resolution bug
@jars creativecommon
@from batches/r1102b/s5_B.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
